              "text": "ફાટક (phāṭak) is usually traced to phāṭṭakka, \"gate, door\", a reconstructed form whose own source CDIAL leaves in doubt. CDIAL lists Hindi phāṭak, \"gate\", but for Gujarati only phaṭkiyũ bārṇũ, \"a single shutter to close a door\" (CDIAL 9069)."
